WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.857
The next question is not simply, which model is biggest?

00:00:03.857 --> 00:00:09.737
The better question is, what problem are we solving, how will we measure success,

00:00:09.737 --> 00:00:13.228
and what is the smallest model that satisfies the requirement?

00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:21.270
We will connect model size to quality, memory, quantization, latency, hardware, and deployment.
